  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_header.webp\" alt=\"標頭圖片\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_promo.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_description.webp\" alt=\"描述\"></p><p><strong>復古動畫</strong>全面翻新了基本動作的動畫效果，如砍伐、挖掘、採集和耕作。這個模組非常適合用來增強遊戲的<strong>沉浸感</strong>和<strong>角色扮演機制</strong>。這些動畫的靈感來自遊戲《Vintage Story》的動畫風格。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_compatibility.webp\" alt=\"相容性\"></p><p>如果某個模組未標記為相容，仍有可能正常運作。若無法使用，請回報問題，我會嘗試為其添加相容性支援。</p><ul>\n<li>Better Combat ✅</li>\n<li>First Person Model ✅</li>\n<li>Real Camera ✅</li>\n<li>Epic Fight ❌</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_showcase.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fRaub0R2ezv0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/Raub0R2ezv0</a></p>",
